,"x":"Then I will discuss our increased guidance for the fiscal year 2019 which reflects our continued strong momentum.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/05/aerovironment-inc-avav-q3-2019-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"AVAV 2019 Q3","e":"avav","d":"2019-03-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"Given our strong results in the quarter and year to date along with the continued progress we're making to strengthen our financial and operating performance, we have raised our full-year guidance which I will discuss after Teresa's comments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/05/aerovironment-inc-avav-q3-2019-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"AVAV 2019 Q4","e":"avav","d":"2019-06-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Pete Skibitski","x":"And then how much are you guys spending on things like autonomy and AI?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/06/25/aerovironment-inc-avav-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"AVAV 2019 Q4","e":"avav","d":"2019-06-25","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"We have and we continue to invest heavily in the AI category, otherwise said, previously, we're at the intersection of this four-feature defining technologies, very exciting and connectivity software analytics, AI, Artificial Intelligence is a very critical and component of our solutions even…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/06/25/aerovironment-inc-avav-q4-2019-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"AVAV 2020 Q1","e":"avav","d":"2019-09-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"With 75% full year visibility to the midpoint of our revenue guidance range, we reiterate our guidance of $350 million to $370 million in revenue, $1.35 to $1.55 in diluted EPS, and $1.47 to $1.67 in non-GAAP diluted EPS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/09/04/aerovironment-inc-avav-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"AVAV 2020 Q1","e":"avav","d":"2019-09-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"In the meantime, we're very confident in the capability of this solution set, and our ability to be able to execute our plan as we stated our -- reiterated our guidance for this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/09/04/aerovironment-inc-avav-q1-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"AVAV 2020 Q2","e":"avav","d":"2019-12-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"With 89% of full year visibility to the midpoint of our revenue guidance range, as described on slide number nine, we reiterate our guidance of $350 million to $370 million in revenue, $1.35 to $1.55 in diluted EPS and $1.47 to $1.67 in non-GAAP diluted EPS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/12/03/aerovironment-inc-avav-q2-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"AVAV 2020 Q3","e":"avav","d":"2020-03-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"I will then discuss our goals and increased guidance for fiscal year 2020 before Kevin, Steve and I take your questions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/03/aerovironment-inc-avav-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"AVAV 2020 Q3","e":"avav","d":"2020-03-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"With 98% full year visibility to the midpoint of our revenue guidance range, as described on slide number 8, and a number of contract negotiations under way, we reiterate our guidance of $350 million to $370 million in revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/03/aerovironment-inc-avav-q3-2020-earnings-call-trans.aspx"},{"c":"AVAV 2021 Q1","e":"avav","d":"2020-09-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"And we feel very confident about our plans today, that's why we reaffirmed our guidance that we provided earlier.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/09/09/aerovironment-inc-avav-q1-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"AVAV 2021 Q2","e":"avav","d":"2020-12-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kevin McDonnell","x":"No, we don't have an exact quantification of that, but we are maintaining our guidance for the year and, but obviously with COVID restrictions there has been situations where demos and things like this get delayed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/12/08/aerovironment-inc-avav-q2-2021-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"AVAV 2022 Q1","e":"avav","d":"2021-09-08","l":"theater","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Arment","x":"Wahid, hey, we get this question a lot regarding just as less boots come out of theater -- more boots come out of theater, how your kind of MUAS business is positioned to kind of perform for kind of services on demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/08/aerovironment-inc-avav-q1-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"AVAV 2022 Q1","e":"avav","d":"2021-09-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"It's an exciting development that we believe will streamline command and control decision making and improve overall effectiveness in the field while opening new opportunities for growth and value creation for AeroVironment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/08/aerovironment-inc-avav-q1-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"AVAV 2022 Q1","e":"avav","d":"2021-09-08","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"We're also reaffirming our guidance for non-GAAP earnings per diluted share, which excludes acquisition-related expenses, amortization of acquired intangible assets and other non-cash purchase accounting adjustments to be between $2.50 and $2.70.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/09/08/aerovironment-inc-avav-q1-2022-earnings-call-trans/"},{"c":"AVAV 2022 Q3","e":"avav","d":"2022-03-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"We're not content with this margin performance, and we'll touch on some of our cost-saving initiatives in a moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/03/aerovironment-avav-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2022 Q3","e":"avav","d":"2022-03-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"At the same time, we remain focused on managing our general and administrative expenses, which includes reducing headcount and non-core functions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/03/aerovironment-avav-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2022 Q3","e":"avav","d":"2022-03-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"With 95% visibility to the mid-point of our previously stated guidance, we are reaffirming our guidance for fiscal year 2022 as follows: full-year revenue between $440 million and $460 million, net loss from continuing operations between $12 million and $8 million, adjusted EBITDA between $59…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/03/aerovironment-avav-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2022 Q3","e":"avav","d":"2022-03-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"And the short answer is, overall, as I said on the comments, that we feel confident about our ability to achieve the reaffirmed guidance that we provided based on the variables and the facts and the conditions that we see today.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/03/03/aerovironment-avav-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2022 Q4","e":"avav","d":"2022-06-28","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"While the timing of such task orders is still being finalized, we anticipate a significant positive impact to our fiscal year and beyond given the U.S. Army's plan to procure Switchblades for the European theater, particularly within NATO countries in Ukraine's proximity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/05/aerovironment-avav-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2022 Q4","e":"avav","d":"2022-06-28","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"In addition, during the last 15 years and the Persian, the Middle East as well as Afghanistan, most of our allies have been with the United States witnessing the efficacy of Switchblade in those theaters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/05/aerovironment-avav-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2022 Q4","e":"avav","d":"2022-06-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"As we discussed previously, we have also been evaluating restructuring and financing options for HAPSMobile.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/05/aerovironment-avav-q4-2022-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2023 Q2","e":"avav","d":"2022-12-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"This is yet another example of how our investments in R&D and especially in artificial intelligence and computer vision further enhances our solutions capabilities to -- for our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/12/07/aerovironment-avav-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2023 Q2","e":"avav","d":"2022-12-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"So far this year, our companywide continuous improvement initiatives have delivered significant cost savings, while positioning us for growth and scale.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/12/07/aerovironment-avav-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2024 Q1","e":"avav","d":"2023-09-05","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"Admiral Phil Davidson brings extensive knowledge of battlefield operations, especially in the INDOPACOM theater and the deployment of new defense capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/09/05/aerovironment-avav-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2024 Q1","e":"avav","d":"2023-09-05","