 initiative within the U.S. DOD is, by far, highly, highly focused to the INDOPACOM theater, and the conflicts are brewing there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/06/26/aerovironment-avav-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2025 Q1","e":"avav","d":"2024-09-04","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Kenneth Herbert","x":"Hey, Wahid, maybe just first, I wanted to ask, you obviously maintained the full-year guide with the IDIQ contract you were able to sign last week or announced last week.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/09/04/aerovironment-avav-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2025 Q2","e":"avav","d":"2024-12-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"It's part of our plans to eventually provide our customer with a holistic common operating picture of our entire portfolio of solutions set, including any other third-party platforms and assets that are potentially in the theater or in the battlefield.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/12/04/aerovironment-avav-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2025 Q2","e":"avav","d":"2024-12-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"That's why we reaffirmed our guidance on the top line and the non-GAAP EBIT profitability numbers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/12/04/aerovironment-avav-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2025 Q3","e":"avav","d":"2025-03-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"Further, the U.S. government recently paused military aid to Ukraine and implemented new tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/04/aerovironment-avav-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcrip/"},{"c":"AVAV 2025 Q3","e":"avav","d":"2025-03-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Wahid Nawabi","x":"Regardless of that, our ability to grow next year despite this particular event and despite the tariffs is very, very good.","url":"